      "about": {
        "authors": [
          "RustCrypto Developers"
        ],
        "description": "The ChaCha20 stream cipher (RFC 8439) implemented in pure Rust using traits\nfrom the RustCrypto `cipher` crate, with optional architecture-specific\nhardware acceleration (AVX2, SSE2). Additionally provides the ChaCha8, ChaCha12,\nXChaCha20, XChaCha12 and XChaCha8 stream ciphers, and also optional\nrand_core-compatible RNGs based on those ciphers.",
